"Mountain Trail"
"You are standing on the east side of a major saddle.  To the west and below
lies the Medienne forest, and to the east and below, the great Vaasa forest.
To the west the trail leads across the saddle while the trail heads almost
directly down in the other direction.  Off in the cloudy distance, you can see
the high summit of the great Dragonspire mountains.  A patch of @Eice@n lies to
the north, seeming to connect to a long trail through the snow.  As your gaze
comes back down from the mountain, you see an amazing stone @bmonument.@n The
granite is not in the least bit intricate or detailed in design, except for
its perfect simplicity.
"
